%% alt: A query embedding is first filtered by tenant, permissions and date, then searched in an approximate nearest-neighbour index; the top k candidates are optionally rescored and passed on to fusion and reranking (3.4).
flowchart LR
  Q[Query embedding]:::data --> F{Filter: tenant,<br/>permissions, date}:::control
